    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i feel like some of the locals are gonna be really pushy about how it'll ruin the \"feel\" of the neighborhood. how should i handle those arguments? like, is there a way to explain why those concerns about losing community character don't really matter in the long run?",
